","file_size":1076983,"filename":"sa110_notes_2023_Cymraeg.pdf","hoc_paper_number":"","id":"9207605","isbn":"","locale":"cy","number_of_pages":56,"title":"Nodiadau ar gyfer Crynodeb o'r Cyfrifiad Treth (2023)","unique_reference":"","unnumbered_command_paper":false,"unnumbered_hoc_paper":false,"url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6426d0b87de82b00123133a9/sa110_notes_2023_Cymraeg.pdf"}],"body":"<div class=\"govspeak\"><p>Use the SA110 supplementary pages when filing your SA100 Tax Return to record the amount due or overpaid for:</p>\n\n<ul>\n  <li>tax</li>\n  <li>student loan repayments</li>\n  <li>Class 4 National Insurance contributions</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>You should include in the calculation any:</p>\n\n<ul>\n  <li>underpaid tax</li>\n  <li>payments on account</li>\n  <li>surplus allowances</li>\n  <li>adjustments to tax due</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>Only complete the SA110 supplementary pages if you’re calculating your tax liability.</p>\n</div>","change_history":[{"note":"The tax calculation summary and notes have been added for tax year 2025 to 2026 and the versions for tax year 2021 to 2022 have been removed.","public_timestamp":"2026-04-05T23:15:22Z"},{"note":"The tax calculation summary and notes have been added for tax year 2024 to 2025 and the versions for tax year 2020 to 2021 have been removed.\r\n\r\n","public_timestamp":"2025-04-05T23:15:15Z"},{"note":"The English and Welsh Tax calculation summary notes for 2024 have been replaced.","public_timestamp":"2024-06-27T07:16:50Z"},{"note":"The tax calculation summary and notes have been added for tax year 2023to 2024 and the versions for tax year 2019 to 2020 removed.","public_timestamp":"2024-04-05T23:01:02Z"},{"note":"The tax calculation summary and notes have been added for tax year 2022 to 2023 and the 2019 versions removed.","public_timestamp":"2023-04-05T23:15:22Z"},{"note":"The tax calculation summary form and notes have been added for tax year 2021 to 2022 and the 2018 versions removed.","public_timestamp":"2022-04-05T23:15:16Z"},{"note":"The form and notes have been added for tax year 2020 to 2021.","public_timestamp":"2021-04-05T23:15:27Z"},{"note":"The English and Welsh Tax calculation summary notes for 2017 have been replaced.","public_timestamp":"2020-10-19T14:06:02Z"},{"note":"The Welsh Tax calculation summary notes for 2020 have been replaced.","public_timestamp":"2020-05-29T14:40:00Z"},{"note":"We have updated the Tax calculation summary notes make corrections on page 13 and 38","public_timestamp":"2020-05-07T13:55:26Z"},{"note":"The form and notes have been added for tax year 2019 to 2020.\r\n","public_timestamp":"2020-04-05T23:30:03Z"},{"note":"The English and Welsh Tax calculation summary notes (2018) have been updated at Box D13 as the Class 4 lower profit limit figure has changed.","public_timestamp":"2019-12-13T15:08:15Z"},{"note":"The Tax calculation summary form for tax year 2018 to 2019 and notes have been added and the English and Welsh notes for 2017 have been updated.","public_timestamp":"2019-04-05T23:15:07Z"},{"note":"The form and notes have been added for tax year 2017 to 2018.","public_timestamp":"2018-04-05T23:45:19Z"},{"note":"The Tax calculation summary notes (2017) have been updated so that you can calculate the best way to use your personal allowance.","public_timestamp":"2017-06-16T13:08:49Z"},{"note":"The form and notes have been added for tax year 2016 to 2017.","public_timestamp":"2017-04-05T23:45:17Z"},{"note":"Updated English and Welsh PDFs for 'Tax calculation summary notes (2016)' at pages TCSN 33 and TCSN 34","public_timestamp":"2017-01-12T11:04:59Z"},{"note":"Amendment to 'Tax calculation summary notes (2016)' at page TCSN 24. Section 'Payments on account' - text above box A324 now reads as; A309 minus (A301 + A304 + A314 + A321).\r\n","public_timestamp":"2016-12-07T15:04:36Z"},{"note":"Amended line 2 and box j1 in section 20 on page 42 of Tax calculation summary notes (2016) English and Welsh versions.","public_timestamp":"2016-06-09T12:39:29Z"},{"note":"Rates, allowances and duties have been updated for the tax year 2016 to 2017.","public_timestamp":"2016-04-05T23:30:19Z"},{"note":"The  2015 to 2016 form has been added to this page.\r\n\r\n","public_timestamp":"2015-04-05T23:30:37Z"},{"note":"Page 37 has been amended to show the correct Annual exempt amount of £10,900 for 2013 to 2014.","public_timestamp":"2014-12-08T14:14:55Z"},{"note":"Added translation","public_timestamp":"2014-04-03T23:00:00Z"}],"document_type_label":"Form","documents":["<section data-module=\"ga4-link-tracker\" class=\"gem-c-attachment govuk-!-margin-bottom-6\">\n  <div class=\"gem-c-attachment__thumbnail govuk-!-display-none-print\">\n    <a class=\"govuk-link\" target=\"_self\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-ga4-link=\"{&quot;event_name&quot;:&quot;file_download&quot;,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;attachment&quot;}\" href=\"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/69c4fc1123fcbcd838a6f6e8/SA110-2026.pdf\">\n        <svg class=\"gem-c-attachment__thumbnail-image gem-c-attachment__thumbnail-image--pdf\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 99 140\">\n  <path d=\"M12,59h9v9h-9v-9ZM30,77v9h39v-9H30ZM30,104h57v-9H30v9ZM30,122h48v-9H30v9ZM12,86h9v-9h-9v9ZM12,122h9v-9h-9v9ZM12,104h9v-9h-9v9ZM30,68h57v-9H30v9ZM35.2,21c-.3-.2-.6-.4-1-.5s-.8-.2-1.3-.2h-2.6v5.5h2.6c.5,0,1,0,1.3-.2s.7-.3,1-.5c.3-.2.5-.5.7-.8s.2-.7.2-1.1h0c0-.5,0-.9-.2-1.2-.2-.3-.4-.6-.7-.8h0ZM52.4,21.9c-.4-.5-1-.9-1.6-1.1-.7-.3-1.5-.4-2.4-.4h-2.7v11.5h2.7c.9,0,1.7-.1,2.4-.4s1.2-.7,1.6-1.1c.4-.5.7-1.1.9-1.7.2-.7.3-1.4.3-2.1v-.7c0-.8,0-1.5-.3-2.1-.2-.6-.5-1.2-.9-1.7h0ZM87,12v27H12V12h75ZM39.8,23c0-.9-.1-1.6-.4-2.4-.3-.7-.7-1.4-1.2-1.9-.5-.5-1.2-1-1.9-1.2-.8-.3-1.6-.5-2.5-.5h-7.2v17.9h3.6v-6h3.2c.9,0,1.8-.1,2.6-.5.8-.3,1.4-.7,2-1.2.5-.5,1-1.2,1.3-1.9.3-.7.5-1.5.5-2.4h0ZM57.4,26c0-1.3-.2-2.6-.5-3.7s-.9-2-1.6-2.8c-.7-.8-1.6-1.4-2.7-1.8-1.1-.4-2.3-.6-3.8-.6h-6.6v17.9h6.6c1.5,0,2.7-.2,3.8-.6,1.1-.4,2-1,2.7-1.8.7-.8,1.3-1.7,1.6-2.8.4-1.1.5-2.3.5-3.7h0